  "prefLabel": "Rev 405.02 Residency Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 405.02 Residency Requirements. The applicant shall have been a New Hampshire resident for at least one year preceding April 1 in the tax year in which the tax credit for combat service is claimed.\n\nSource. #12925, eff 11-26-19",
